          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.68,
          "end": 104.96000000000001,
          "en": "because I wanna have that card look around the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.72,
          "en": "And in there we can add a base button.",
