        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.38,
          "end": 123.1,
          "en": "The second button says add resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.1,
          "end": 125.69,
          "en": "because that, you guessed it will take us to the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.69,
          "end": 127.393,
          "en": "add resources component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.17,
          "end": 130.56,
          "en": "And how could we implement this now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.56,
          "end": 133.023,
          "en": "How could we implement this tabs feature?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.92,
          "end": 137.51,
          "en": "We can actually use the dynamic component feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.51,
          "end": 140.64,
          "en": "you learned about in the last course module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.64,
          "end": 144.45,
          "en": "So for that, in the script part here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.45,
          "end": 149.13,
          "en": "I will add my data property to store some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.13,
          "end": 151.82999999999998,
          "en": "that belongs to this component only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.82999999999998,
          "end": 156.82999999999998,
          "en": "And here I wanna manage the currently selected tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.07999999999998,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "Of course that name here is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 163.5,
          "en": "And I'll start with the stored-resources tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.5,
          "end": 166.78,
          "en": "but this can also be changed to add resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.78,
          "end": 168.2,
          "en": "and then I'll use that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.2,
          "end": 171.433,
          "en": "to later switch between the two components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.51,
          "end": 174.39,
          "en": "So now I also want a method of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.39,
          "end": 177.25,
          "en": "which allows me to change the selected tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.25,
          "end": 179.4,
          "en": "So let's add this methods option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.4,
          "end": 181.74,
          "en": "to this configuration object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.74,
          "end": 185.93,
          "en": "and here I'll add a set selected tab method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.93,
          "end": 187.18,
          "en": "where I get the tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.18,
          "end": 189.28,
          "en": "that should be selected as our argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.28,
          "end": 192.783,
          "en": "and then we can set this selected tab equal to tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.84,
          "end": 197.3,
          "en": "Now where should this method be called?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.3,
          "end": 199.32,
          "en": "That would be our buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.32,
          "end": 202.21,
          "en": "So here on the first button, upon a click",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.21,
          "end": 206.46,
          "en": "I want to call this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 209.09,
          "en": "So I will point at set selected tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.09,
          "end": 211.39,
          "en": "and tell you how to execute it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.39,
          "end": 213.76,
          "en": "Here you should then execute it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.76,
          "end": 216.523,
          "en": "with an argument of stored resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.75,
          "end": 219.68,
          "en": "And here for add resource,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.68,
          "end": 224.68,
          "en": "I'll also add a click and set selected tab to add resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.91,
          "end": 230.13,
          "en": "And now let's take a quick pause here at this point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.13,
          "end": 232.07999999999998,
          "en": "because I'm doing something here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.07999999999998,
          "end": 234.93,
          "en": "which we actually haven't done before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.93,
          "end": 237.17000000000002,
          "en": "And do you see what that is?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.17000000000002,
          "end": 239.983,
          "en": "It has nothing to do with dynamic components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.14,
          "end": 245.04,
          "en": "I'm adding a click listener on base button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.04,
          "end": 248.46,
          "en": "Well, on the one hand this might not be too fancy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.46,
          "end": 250.48,
          "en": "we added click listeners to buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.48,
          "end": 252.34,
          "en": "for all the entire course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.34,
          "end": 255.17,
          "en": "But keep in mind, this is no regular button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 255.17,
          "end": 257.84,
          "en": "This is our own custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.84,
          "end": 260.6,
          "en": "why can't I add a click listener on it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.6,
          "end": 264.8,
          "en": "I mean, click after all is not a custom event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.8,
          "end": 266.22,
          "en": "I'm emitting in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.22,
          "end": 268.13,
          "en": "If we have a look at the base button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 268.13,
          "end": 270.83,
          "en": "this component doesn't emit any event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 270.83,
          "end": 274.06,
          "en": "and here on this button, on the native HTML button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.06,
          "end": 275.663,
          "en": "there is no click listener.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.92,
          "end": 281.28,
          "en": "This is actually a special behavior Vue has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.28,
          "end": 286.28,
          "en": "When you add props or event listeners on custom components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 286.63,
          "end": 290.15,
          "en": "then by default they fall through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 290.15,
          "end": 292.17,
          "en": "to the root level element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 292.17,
          "end": 294.633,
          "en": "in that custom components template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.89,
          "end": 300.01,
          "en": "So if I add any props or event listeners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.01,
          "end": 302.43,
          "en": "to base button for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.43,
          "end": 305.6,
          "en": "they will fall through and will be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.6,
          "end": 310.24,
          "en": "to the root HTML element in base button's template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 310.24,
          "end": 313.71,
          "en": "which in this case is the native HTML button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 313.71,
          "end": 316.19,
          "en": "So this click listener here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 316.19,
          "end": 321.19,
          "en": "falls through to this native button here in this template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 321.75,
          "end": 325.91,
          "en": "So it's automatically added to this button you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.91,
          "end": 327.76,
          "en": "that's happening behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 327.76,
          "end": 330.53,
          "en": "And that's an important behavior of Vue.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 330.53,
          "end": 332.17,
          "en": "which I'm utilizing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 332.17,
          "end": 333.86,
          "en": "Which we haven't seen before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 333.86,
          "end": 337.51,
          "en": "because we didn't really have a great place for using that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 337.51,
          "end": 340.34000000000003,
          "en": "but here it's absolutely something that helps us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 340.34000000000003,
          "end": 342.363,
          "en": "for wrapping this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 343.26,
          "end": 345.46,
          "en": "So with that we can add this click listener here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 345.46,
          "end": 349.83,
          "en": "and change the selected tab upon clicks on those buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 349.83,
          "end": 353.17,
          "en": "Now of course I don't just want you change that data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 353.17,
          "end": 357.73,
          "en": "I also want to reflect the change in the user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 357.73,
          "end": 361.73,
          "en": "To be precise I want to render either the stored resources",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 361.73,
          "end": 364.52,
          "en": "or the add resource component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 364.52,
          "end": 367.59,
          "en": "And therefore below my base card here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.59,
          "end": 371.02,
          "en": "I'll now add the built in component, component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 371.02,
          "end": 373.79,
          "en": "which is that component you use for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 373.79,
          "end": 375.733,
          "en": "dynamic components as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.09,
          "end": 379.69,
          "en": "And here we bind the is prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 379.69,
          "end": 383.47,
          "en": "to tell you which actual component should be rendered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 383.47,
          "end": 386.91,
          "en": "So we need to pass the HTML element tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.91,
          "end": 388.85,
          "en": "off our custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 388.85,
          "end": 391.4,
          "en": "Now that's why I'm using my tags here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 391.4,
          "end": 395.51,
          "en": "as selected tabs stored resources and add resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 395.51,
          "end": 399.55,
          "en": "that will be my custom component HTML tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 399.55,
          "end": 402.693,
          "en": "And therefore here we can point at selected tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.78,
          "end": 406.06,
          "en": "Of course this will now only work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 406.06,
          "end": 409.40999999999997,
          "en": "if we register my own components here though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 409.40999999999997,
          "end": 413.43,
          "en": "Because currently add resource is registered nowhere,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 413.43,
          "end": 418.04,
          "en": "and stored resources is registered in the app.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 418.04,
          "end": 419.87,
          "en": "Now if we register it there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 419.87,
